SUMMARY:ALGT — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: ALLEGIANT TRAVEL CO (ALGT)\nRoadshow: https://www.netroadshow.com/
 events/login/1PeTHmojAMO6crKmRR7m0dPIqNtzPRfUxkHdz\n\nDeal context:\nAlleg
 iant Travel Company (ALGT) is bringing a $500 million First Lien Senior Se
 cured Notes offering with a 5-year tenor\, structured as 144A/Reg S\, with
  Barclays acting as Lead Left and DB and CACIB as Joint Bookrunners. The p
 roceeds will be used to refinance existing Senior Secured Notes due 2027\,
  pay transaction-related fees and expenses\, and for general corporate pur
 poses. The deal features a Non-Call 2 structure with a 103% special call p
 rovision allowing redemption of up to 10% of aggregate principal per annum
  during the non-call period\, and a Change of Control put at 101%\, consis
 tent with the existing notes.
